# Data JSON

- IDs are `snake_case` and unique per category. Do not rename after Phase 11; add `aliases`.
- Every file has `"schema_version": 1`.
- List every data file in `index.json`. Exports cannot enumerate `res://` dirs.
- Cross-references must exist (items, mobs, drops, maps, quests, skills). CI validates schemas.
- Balance constants belong here (`stats.json`, skill `levels`, drop chances), not in GDScript.
- Original names only. Prefix items/quests (`wpn_`, `pot_`, `etc_`, `q_`, `npc_`, `dt_`, `shop_`).
- Currency is Glimmer. Classes are Novice, Vanguard, Arcanist, Ranger, Shade.
